Package: dirplay
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libasound2
Description: A simple music player for the terminal
 Dirplay is a lightweight terminal-based music player written in Go.
 It supports playing audio files from a directory.
